<title>USA: Barnwell takes Michigan energy stake.</title>
<headline>Barnwell takes Michigan energy stake.</headline>
<dateline>HONOLULU, Hawaii 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barnwell Industries Inc said Monday that it has entered into a participation agreement with  KEP Energy Resources LLC and  Presco Inc to develop natural gas and oil reserves in Michigan's Central Basin.</p>
<p>Barnwell said the group has acquired a 12.5 percent interest in the development program, which encompasses about 220,000 net acres, for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>It said nine new wells or re-entries are planned initially, adding they will be operated by Belco Oil &amp; Gas Corp. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
